 * The book of targeted rumor purchases (§11, §16). Requests arrive between ticks; a request id this player already had
 * decided is answered from the book before anything else; one still pending is merged into it (no second place, one
 * answer); at most `MAX_PENDING_RUMORS` wait per player. The room takes at most one per player per tick, oldest first.
